@startuml 09-state-preserving-fork-choice
!theme plain

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #263238
  LifeLineBorderColor #455A64
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  ParticipantBorderColor #37474F
  ParticipantFontColor #102027
}
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor<<commit>> #D1C4E9
  BackgroundColor<<latest>> #BBDEFB
  BackgroundColor<<auth>> #E1BEE7
  BackgroundColor<<vote>> #FFCDD2
  BackgroundColor<<choice>> #FFE082
  BackgroundColor<<bound>> #D7CCC8
  BackgroundColor<<evidence>> #F8BBD0
  BackgroundColor<<closure>> #C8E6C9
  BackgroundColor<<replay>> #B2DFDB
  BackgroundColor<<block>> #FFECB3
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #F57F17
}
skinparam defaultFontName "monospace"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title Causal parent retention, GHOST identity, and certified-floor replay

participant "Captured LFB\nF" as LFB <<commit>>
participant "Exact latest slots\n{P1, P2, D}" as Latest <<latest>>
participant "Base-admissible\ncausal projection" as Causal <<auth>>
participant "Floor-descending\nvote projection" as Vote <<vote>>
participant "Estimator and\ndirect parents" as Choice <<choice>>
participant "Depth expiry and\nrecovery guard" as Bound <<bound>>
participant "Evidence roots" as Evidence <<evidence>>
participant "Parent causal\nclosure" as Closure <<closure>>
participant "Deterministic\nmerge replay" as Replay <<replay>>
participant "Proposed block" as Block <<block>>

Latest -[#7B1FA2]> Causal : certify authority, admission,\nsender, generation, non-equivocation
Causal -[#C62828]> Vote : retain only tips descending from F
Vote -[#C62828]> Choice : LMD-GHOST votes and main tip
Causal -[#2E7D32]> Choice : declared-parent candidates\ninclude valid stale tip D
LFB -[#F57C00]> Choice : add F when no causal candidate descends from F
Choice -[#2E7D32]> Bound : reachability-maximal antichain\nwith GHOST head first
Bound -[#2E7D32]> Closure : expire only deterministic deep tips;\nnarrow recovery only if main covers\nlive tips and descends from F
Closure -[#2E7D32]> Replay : all above-floor causal inputs
LFB -[#1565C0]> Replay : protected floor state
Replay -[#2E7D32]> Block : floor state + accepted deltas\nexactly reject conflicting deltas
Bound -[#2E7D32]> Block : declare bounded live antichain
Latest -[#AD1457]> Evidence : every exact latest hash
LFB -[#AD1457]> Evidence : F always remains a root

note over Causal, Block
D remains causal input but has no vote after F finalizes. If D expires from
the live parent horizon it still remains an exact evidence root. Deploy policy
cannot replace the GHOST main parent, and no merge rejection may erase an
effect already represented by the certified floor.
end note

Latest -[#546E7A]> Causal : alternate snapshot has only stale disjoint tips
LFB -[#F57C00]> Choice : explicit backstop parent = F

@enduml
